# Inference is configured centrally — set NEBIUS_API_KEY in the repo-root compute.env, one level up
# (../compute.env; copy from ../compute.env.example). See ../COMPUTE.md. OPENROUTER_API_KEY is optional.
# This file is for optional per-project overrides only — it is comments-only, nothing required here.
#
# Both games (Collusion_Liars_Bar and Collusion_Cleanup) share this config. Each of the four
# agents runs a different model; the mapping from short names to model ids lives in each game's
# llm_client.py (see README, "Models").
